# Foundry

Multi-agent Next.js 15 app. Conductor routes founder asks through specialists.

- Source of truth: `AGENTS.md`
- UI: `src/app` + `src/components` (App Router, Tailwind v4)
- Crew: `src/lib/agents` (orchestrator, planner, registry, specialists, tools)
- LLM: `src/lib/llm/complete.ts` (OpenAI-compatible; demo mode if no key)

Do not add a second agent framework. Extend the existing crew loop.

Voice: sharp operator, executable weekly actions, no generic startup decks.
